          "kind": "text",
          "text": "It's FluMist, the live attenuated nasal-spray flu vaccine that became fully available in Japan from 2024. Since it's given as a quick spray in each nostril rather than an injection, it's a genuinely reassuring option for children (and parents) who dread needles."
